        "text": "Attack on Titan: Legacy will be a platform where you can collect official #AttackOnTitan digital collectibles, licensed by Kodansha.\n\nCheck out the teaser site here: https://t.co/bfOjAg38t9\n\n#AoTLegacy built #onFlow https://t.co/PE4ZiOwnb3"
